+# Element FM27 Editor roadmap
+
+## v0.2 implemented in source
+- Element FM27 branding and isolated settings directory.
+- Player Transfer Lab tab.
+- Editable FM27 mapped transfer-list and loan-list flags.
+- Editable asking price, contract wage and contract expiry in Transfer Lab.
+- Existing Club Finance editor retained: balance, transfer budget, spending wage budget; mapped totals shown.
+- Existing Staff Tactical Knowledge and Tactical Style editors retained.
+- Advanced transfer actions are deliberately locked until linked FM27 records are verified.
+
+## Next memory-research targets
+1. Interested-club / transfer-interest records (Attract Clubs).
+2. Future-transfer record creation: destination, fee, date, contract.
+3. Atomic Move Player Now across player/team/contract/squad registrations.
+4. Tactical familiarity / team cohesion / morale / condition/injuries.
+5. Mass Edit, Presets and Freezer.
+
+Always back up saves. Writes occur in the running FM process and can persist when FM saves.
